{"id":"9817d6d80eee4f8c","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma.md","title":"扩展图混合引理","display":"thm-expander-mixing-lemma — 扩展图混合引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma","aliases":["28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma"],"display":"thm-expander-mixing-lemma — 扩展图混合引理","depends_on":["[[28-df-spectral-expander]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 21.11; printed p.429; PDF p.455","source_printed_pages":"429","source_pdf_pages":"455","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","proof_status":"local-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-expander-mixing-lemma — 扩展图混合引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 21.11; printed p.429; PDF p.455"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"429"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"455"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq[N]\">\\(S,T\\subseteq[N]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G\">\\(E_G\\)</span> 按有向端口计数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)\">\\(\\lambda(G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G\">\\(P_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_N\">\\(u_N\\)</span> 和范数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a> 及其上游。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left||E_G(S,T)|-\\frac{D|S||T|}{N}\\right|\\le D\\lambda(G)\\sqrt{|S|\\left(1-\\frac{|S|}{N}\\right)|T|\\left(1-\\frac{|T|}{N}\\right)}\\le D\\lambda(G)\\sqrt{|S||T|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left||E_G(S,T)|-\\frac{D|S||T|}{N}\\right|\\le D\\lambda(G)\\sqrt{|S|\\left(1-\\frac{|S|}{N}\\right)|T|\\left(1-\\frac{|T|}{N}\\right)}\\le D\\lambda(G)\\sqrt{|S||T|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书引理21.11给出右侧的较粗界，并将证明留作习题21.14；第一个更精确界是本地推导。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\">\\(s,t\\)</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\">\\(S,T\\)</span> 的指示向量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 1=(1,\\ldots,1)\">\\(\\mathbf 1=(1,\\ldots,1)\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=(|S|/N)\\mathbf 1+s_0\">\\(s=(|S|/N)\\mathbf 1+s_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=(|T|/N)\\mathbf 1+t_0\">\\(t=(|T|/N)\\mathbf 1+t_0\\)</span>。两个零和分量的平方范数分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|S|(1-|S|/N)\">\\(|S|(1-|S|/N)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T|(1-|T|/N)\">\\(|T|(1-|T|/N)\\)</span>。平稳性与对称性消去交叉项，故边数误差等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D|\\langle t_0,P_Gs_0\\rangle|\">\\(D|\\langle t_0,P_Gs_0\\rangle|\\)</span>，再用谱参数定义与 Cauchy–Schwarz。</p>\n<p>空集、全集、重叠集合、自环和重边都受相同公式覆盖。若将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G(S,T)\">\\(E_G(S,T)\\)</span> 改成不计方向的边集合而允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\">\\(S,T\\)</span> 重叠，公式会失去正确的乘数；因此本条显式绑定端口计数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$S,T\\subseteq[N]$；$E_G$ 按有向端口计数，$\\lambda(G)$、$P_G$、$u_N$ 和范数见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq[N]","display":false},{"tex":"E_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)","display":false},{"tex":"P_G","display":false},{"tex":"u_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\left||E_G(S,T)|-\\frac{D|S||T|}{N}\\right|\\le D\\lambda(G)\\sqrt{|S|\\left(1-\\frac{|S|}{N}\\right)|T|\\left(1-\\frac{|T|}{N}\\right)}\\le D\\lambda(G)\\sqrt{|S||T|}.","display":true},{"tex":"s,t","display":false},{"tex":"S,T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf 1=(1,\\ldots,1)","display":false},{"tex":"s=(|S|/N)\\mathbf 1+s_0","display":false},{"tex":"t=(|T|/N)\\mathbf 1+t_0","display":false},{"tex":"|S|(1-|S|/N)","display":false},{"tex":"|T|(1-|T|/N)","display":false},{"tex":"D|\\langle t_0,P_Gs_0\\rangle|","display":false},{"tex":"E_G(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"S,T","display":false}],"bytes":1603,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"}],"outgoing":["df14955ee1f08cd3"]}